            "id": 126522,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>batteryLevel</code> kurang dari atau sama dengan <code>20</code> menggunakan operator kurang dari atau sama dengan, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" batteryLevel = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" low = batteryLevel &lt;= \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low battery: \\(low)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"47\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Low battery: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
